<title>USA: Jostens Inc Q1 September 30 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Jostens Inc Q1 September 30 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.13   profit	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net	 loss	   5,027   profit	 2,513</p>
<p> Revs		     105,399		   97,754</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,656		   43,760</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: Q1 1996 loss includes declines from new inventory cost accounting system which shifted about $0.15 a share in earnings from first quarter to fourth, and $2 million in interest expense vs $200,000 in 1995.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdewsk, 312-408-8787</p>
